      "description": "Senior Programmer Analyst:        \n•\tExtensive knowledge developing applications using Java/J2EE in WebSphere RAD8/WAS7 environment.\n•\tExperience in architecture, design and development of large distributed applications.\n•\tExcellent knowledge of JSP, Servlets, JMS, JNDI, JDBC, HTML, EJB, DAO JavaScript,  XMLSpy, CVS, JPA and JSF. \n•\tKnowledge of the Spring Framework and Hibernate.\n•\tHighly proficient in DB2 and solid knowledge of stored procedures and triggers in PL/SQL.\n•\tExperience using XML-based standards and protocols (such as WSDL and SOAP), Service Oriented Architecture (SOA) and implementing Web Services. \t\n•\tExpertise in XML technologies such as XSL, XSLT, XML schemas, XPath, XSL-FO and parsers like SAX and DOM. \n•\tExperience in using UML tool such as Rational Rose, design patterns and industry best practices such as MVC (Model-View-Controller).\n•\tReviews Business Requirements & Functional Specifications, facilitates communication with Business Analysts in order to gain understanding of the business functionalities and then creates Detailed Design documents for development. \n•\tInvolved in all the phases of Software Development Life Cycle - Requirements, Design, Construction, Testing and Implementation. \n•\tExpertise in writing Technical Specification Document (TSD) and reviewing Functional Design Specification (FDS), Solution Requirement Document (SRS), Business Requirement Document (BRS) and user stories and use cases. \n•\tProficient in creating Test Plans, Test Cases and Test data.  Use defect management tools such as Quality Center to reassign and track defects report by QA.\n•\tWorked closely with Architects for creating POC, System summary, Solution Design to identify potential problems and analyzing complex technical situations. \n\n\n\n",
